00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.227
- Hi, welcome everybody.

00:00:08.227 --> 00:00:12.960
We are delighted to see all
of you attend this webinar

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.620
which is the second event

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.450
in the series of How to
Join the Quantum Workforce.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.680
My name is, Florian Carle

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.570
I'm the Manager of the
Yale Quantum Institute

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:23.940
and I'll be one of the
moderators for this panel.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.790
We are delighted to continue the series

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:26.990
